companies who are using

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.060
a microservice
architecture instead

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.260
of traditional
monolithic stacks."

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:11.760
Definitely.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.051
And thanks for writing in, Dan.

00:02:13.051 --> 00:02:15.390
We have many customer
